OL,9,G0245 The New Statesman
OL,10,     FAfter surviving an attempt on his
OL,11,     Flife, Alan backs hanging but lands
OL,12,     Fon death row for a murder he did
OL,13,     Fnot commit.
OL,14,G0400 Agony
